TTS data and model metadata
---------------------------
The CI build generates app/src/main/assets/cmu_lexicon.json from pinned CMUdict and
FrequencyWords revisions. Their source and attribution terms are recorded in
app/src/main/assets/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt. CMUdict is copyrighted by Carnegie Mellon
University; it is not described here as public domain. Its upstream README permits
research and commercial use and requests acknowledgement.

The build also generates ljspeech_id_map.json from the pinned rhasspy/piper-voices
revision. The LJSpeech medium and high voice cards identify the LJ Speech dataset as
public domain. This dataset statement does not assert that the Piper engine or every
other component is public domain.
